n  outlawed The Incredibles enjoy fans and  celeb status Elsa Scarlet Witch we love  Elsa we can't get enough of her we're  just suckers for powerful women Elsa is  the ultra powerful queen of arendelle  she was born with her magical powers to  control ice and weather she has a deep  and meaningful relationship with her  siblings her bond with Ana's saved her  life and her kingdom the comic book  world has another powerful woman in it  and it reminds us of the frozen Queen  Scarlett which is every bit as powerful  as the Disney Princess her magic has the  ability to bend reality where Elsa  controls snowflakes Scarlet Witch  controls events in time she can make gas  lines  explode or cause an evil robot to  short-circuit the power these two women  yield is incredible that's not the only  thing they have in common both of them  have a sibling that means the world to  them Scarlet Witch has a twin brother  Quicksilver when her parents abandoned  the twins they leaned on each other for  support they were raised by foster  parents but never lost sight of who  their real family was each other  Elsa and Anna have that kind of bond too  they lost their parents and had to rely  on each other for support these super  sisters have a lot in common  Rapunzel spider-man this comparison may  seem like a stretch at first glance but  hear us out both of these characters  have a tragic family history Rapunzel  was taken from her family as a baby  Peter Parker lost his Uncle Ben and it  changed him forever both of these  characters have grown and evolved after  their trauma both characters have a  similar look and energy to Peter Parker  and Rapunzel are both on the younger  side a lot of attention is paid to how  much heat Peter takes for being a kid he  seems to get pushed around a lot  becoming spider-man is hugely empowering  for him and totally changes his  personality he gains a ton of confidence  and even becomes kind of cocky for a  second  Rapunzel's youth is only emphasized