other she also had an  epic run-in with Ursula these two  aquatic women have one very important  thing in common they're both strong and  incredibly resilient each woman has  survived a painful loss and incredible  obstacles both they're married to the  men of their dreams Mara and Aquaman  have had some issues but what married  couple hasn't Arielle and Mara both have  the bright red hair to match their  personalities we hope you loved our  comparisons between Disney and DC Marvel  characters we'll see you next time  [Music]

